{"schema":"ostadix.aicore-local-probe/v1","request_id":"canonical-nano-o-chat-20260917-1743","pid":27816,"uid":10173,"phase":"generation_result","success":true,"native_call_active":false,"elapsed_realtime_ms":56183887,"deadline_elapsed_ms":56233763,"inference_dispatched":true,"inference_returned":true,"detail":{"artifact":"canonical-nano-o-chat-20260917-1743.generation-response.962d883093993c2e5ccd0bd38855124be896a6ffa93cfbc5e6660eb34e29846e.json","artifact_sha256":"14b851a34b3711d705d139a530b41363ae40e48103fc89e344dc79cfb77806eb","protobuf_sha256":"962d883093993c2e5ccd0bd38855124be896a6ffa93cfbc5e6660eb34e29846e","protobuf_bytes":1410,"candidates":[{"text":"```ostadix\nlet parts = autonomous(batch(\npython^(\n    rows = []\n    for line in input.splitlines():\n        row = line.split(',')\n        id = int(row[0])\n        depot = row[1]\n        units = int(row[2])\n        rows.append((id, depot, units))\n    __oval_result__ = rows\n)_python,\nrust^(\n    fn main() {\n        let mut a = 2;\n        let mut b = 3;\n        let mut fib_numbers: Vec<i32> = Vec::new();\n        fib_numbers.push(a);\n        fib_numbers.push(b);\n\n        loop {\n            let next = a + b;\n            if next > 20 {\n                break;\n            }\n            fib_numbers.push(next);\n            a = b;\n            b = next;\n        }\n\n        println!(\"{:?}\", fib_numbers);\n    }\n)_rust,\nbash^(\n    printf '%s\\n' 'south\\nnorth\\nsouth' | sort -u\n)_bash\n))\npython^(\n    rows, ids, sites = $parts\n    selected_ids = []\n    totals = {}\n    total_units = 0\n\n    for id, depot, units in rows:\n        if id in ids and depot in sites:\n            selected_ids.append(id)\n            if depot in totals:\n                totals[depot] += units\n            else:\n                totals[depot] = units\n            total_units += units\n\n    __oval_result__ = {\n        \"selected_ids\": selected_ids,\n        \"totals\": totals,\n        \"total_units\": total_units\n    }\n)_python\n```","text_truncated_in_event":false,"score":0,"finish_reason_enum":1}],"callback_count":1220,"cancel_requested":false,"deadline_exceeded":false}}
